+// arrays are equal on both sides (mergo/7 would be named first); the source's maps of interfaces
+// are nil and its times the destination's (mergo/15 and mergo/16 are not the subject); the
+// transformers are off (the Color transformer's error on a "b" would stop the merge). Past the
